Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 15:46:31 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] cg_clif: update to Cranelift 0.137

clif-to-wasm now uses Cranelift 0.137. This is upstream cg_clif's
36fde789 ("Update to Cranelift 0.137", by bjorn3) applied in tree, with
the workspace's Cargo.lock updated to match.
